                  Transparent Labs Grass-Fed Whey Isolate, Momentous Essential, Levels Grass Fed Whey, Garden of Life Sport Organic Plant, Truvani and Just Ingredients are made without sucralose, acesulfame potassium or aspartame in the flavors we describe, using stevia, monk fruit or both. Naked Whey Unflavored contains no sweetener at all. Always confirm the ingredient list for your flavor.
                </p>
